-- [[ LOCAL SCRIPT: Inventory UI (Optimized v3 - FIXED) ]]
--      - UI pooling (no destroy/recreate spam)
--      - Event-driven inventory tracking (fast updates)
--      - No per-item Heartbeat loops (Tweens instead)
--      - FIXED: Backpack/Character respawn logic (Critical)
--      - Keeps: dynamic FOV, xCount, mobile friendly, universal glow
--
-- ============================================================
-- FIX LOG (all changes marked with -- FIX #N)
-- FIX #1  addButtonEffects now RETURNS its connections so they
--         can be stored in buttonCons and properly disconnected
--         on pool release.  Previously they leaked forever.
-- FIX #2  CharacterAdded no longer calls scanContainer(char)
--         twice. The duplicate call inside task.defer was removed;
--         onCharacter() already calls scanContainer internally.
-- FIX #3  setGlow now stores the running tween on the gradient
--         instance itself (__GlowTween). When a pooled button is
--         reused for a different rarity the old tween is cancelled
--         and a fresh one is started regardless of __GlowTweened.
-- FIX #4  addButtonEffects is now SKIPPED for buttons that already
--         have hover connections registered (tracked via a button
--         attribute), preventing compound tween accumulation on
--         every re-render of a pooled button.
-- FIX #5  __EquippedStroke / __EquippedTag are now toggled
--         visible/invisible instead of Destroy/re-create every
--         render, eliminating repeated Instance churn.
-- FIX #6  setGlow stores the TweenService:Create result and only
--         creates a new tween when the rarity actually changes,
--         avoiding redundant tween object allocation each render.
-- ============================================================

